+const char *dvbridge_l5_offsets_area(int width, int height, const unsigned offsets[4], bool of_picture, int area[4])
+{
+    if (width < 2 || height < 2 || width > DVBRIDGE_SOURCE_MAX_WIDTH || height > DVBRIDGE_SOURCE_MAX_HEIGHT)
+        return "the picture is of a size the bridge does not take";
     /* The serializer's reading of the offsets, of the picture placed in the raster as native output places a
      * picture drawn whole at its own shape: at its own size where it fits in 3840x2160, so that the margins are in
-     * its samples; a larger one (up to 4096x2304) scaled down to fit, its margins brought back to its samples. */
+     * its samples; a larger one (up to 4096x2304) scaled down to fit, its margins brought back to its samples.
